              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak orjeeda ghamagheamata siida iighwarda siida gayghwalaalda ak gooruuteawa geaka jeeda gheeda, ak gay gwayeesha niny dea mida jeeda ghooriida, “Gudugwanda siisi indeawi?” gaygwayi, Manda”, ak gaygwayi, “Siinda! aba gideaba majeerukuna gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
